          },
          "relation": "supporting",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 191,
            "text": "theorem movingStrip_domain {coord : ℝ} (U : SlowRegion coord)\n    (a b cL cR : ℝ) (ha : 0 < a) (hcL : 0 < cL) (hcR : 0 < cR)\n    (ε L : ℕ → ℝ) (hε : ∀ n, 0 < ε n) (hεone : ∀ n, ε n ≤ 1) (hL : ∀ n, 1 ≤ L n)\n    (x : Point) :\n    x ∈ (movingStripData U a b cL cR ha hcL hcR ε L hε hεone hL).domain ↔\n      x.2.1 ∈ U.carrier ∧ (profileMap coord x).1 ∈ Ioo a b"
          }
        }
      }
